---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="AAA Playable Games for DroidDeck — DroidDeck Guide"
  description="AAA games that are playable on DroidDeck with lowered settings and FSR. Performance expectations for Android handhelds."
  page="games"
>
  <style>
    .page-header{background:var(--night);color:white;padding:90px 0 50px}
    .page-header h1{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .page-header p{color:#93a7ba;max-width:600px}
    .page-content{padding:50px 0 80px}
    .game-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;font-size:14px}
    .game-table th,.game-table td{padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
    .game-table th{background:#f4f7fa;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted)}
    .game-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
    .fps-mid{font-weight:700;color:#d97706}
    .note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    .source-badge{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px}
  </style>
  
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-label"><span></span> Game Compatibility</div>
        <h1>AAA Playable List</h1>
        <p>Demanding games that can be played on high-end DroidDeck devices with low settings and FSR. Expect 25–40 FPS, not 60.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-content wrap">
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table class="game-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Game</th>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>Performance</th>
              <th>Settings</th>
              <th>Source</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>The Witcher 3</strong></td>
              <td>Open-world RPG</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">30–40 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Low + FSR Quality</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Grand Theft Auto V</strong></td>
              <td>Open-world action</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">30–45 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Normal + FSR</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Dark Souls III</strong></td>
              <td>Action RPG</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">25–35 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Low + FSR Balanced</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice</strong></td>
              <td>Action adventure</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">25–35 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Low + FSR Performance</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Red Dead Redemption 2</strong></td>
              <td>Open-world action</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">20–30 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Low + FSR Performance</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Elden Ring</strong></td>
              <td>Action RPG</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">20–30 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Low + FSR Performance</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Resident Evil 4 (2023)</strong></td>
              <td>Survival horror</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">30–45 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Medium + FSR Balanced</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Devil May Cry 5</strong></td>
              <td>Action</td>
              <td><span class="fps-mid">30–40 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p Low + FSR Quality</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="note" style="margin-top:20px"><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span> entries were tested on Ayn Odin 2 / Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 devices. <span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span> entries are reported by users. Lock your expectations to 25–40 FPS for AAA games.</p>
    </section>
  
  
</Layout>
